---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'China Visa Types Complete Guide 2026: Which Visa Do You Need?';
const description = 'A complete guide to Chinese visa types for tourists in 2026: visa-free, mutual agreements, 240-hour transit, and L-type tourist visa.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Prepare
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">📋 入境和签证</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        China Visa Types Complete Guide 2026<br class="hidden md:block" />: Which Visa Do You Need?
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">进入中国比几年前更容易。以下是你需要知道的。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>你是否需要签证取决于你的护照。</strong> Citizens of 50 countries can enter visa-free for up to 30 days, and another 29 have mutual visa-free agreements. Travelers from 55 countries can use the 240-hour transit policy. Everyone else needs a standard L-type Tourist Visa.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#need-visa" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛂 访问中国需要签证吗？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-long" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">⏱️ 需要多长时间？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#mutual" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🤝 相互免签证协议</a></li>
        <li><a href="#which-option" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🤔 哪种选择适合你？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❓ 常见问题</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>进入中国比几年前更容易。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Depending on your nationality and travel plans, you might be able to enter China without a visa, take advantage of the 240-hour transit policy, or apply for a standard tourist visa. For most travelers, the process is straightforward once you figure out which option applies to your situation.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="need-visa" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛂</span> Do You Need a Visa to Visit China?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>不是每个人都需要传统的中国签证。</strong> There are currently three common ways to enter China:
      </p>

      <!-- Section 1: Visa-Free -->
      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-green-200 text-green-800 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">免签证入境</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          China currently grants visa-free entry to citizens of 50 countries (plus 29 mutual agreement countries) for stays of up to 30 days. If your passport is from one of these countries, you can literally book a flight and walk through Chinese immigration without having applied for anything in advance. Just make sure your passport is valid for at least 6 months beyond your entry date, and you're good to go.
        </p>
        <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
          China Visa-Free Countries List (2026) →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: 240-Hour Transit -->
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-200 text-blue-800 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">240小时免签证过境</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Travelers from eligible countries can stay in China for up to 240 hours (10 days) while transiting to a third country or region (including Hong Kong, Macau, and Taiwan).
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          This option is popular with travelers making stopovers in cities like Shanghai, Beijing, Guangzhou, and Chengdu. <strong>重要提示：</strong> This policy only applies to entries through international airports, not land border crossings.
        </p>
        <a href="/zh/visa/transit-240/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
          China 240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Mutual Agreement -->
      <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-200 text-teal-800 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">相互免签证协议</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          In addition to China's unilateral visa-free policy, China has signed <strong>互免签证协议</strong> with <strong>29个国家</strong>. Citizens of these countries holding ordinary passports can enter China visa-free.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Stay duration varies by agreement — many allow up to <strong>我可以延期吗？</strong> per entry, while some (like Singapore) permit stays of up to <strong>任何180天内的90天</strong>. Always check the specific terms of your country's agreement before traveling.
        </p>
        <a href="/zh/visa/mutual-agreement/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
          Mutual Visa-Free Agreements (29 Countries) →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 4: Tourist Visa -->
      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-200 text-purple-800 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">旅游签证（L型）</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          If neither of the options above works for you, you'll typically need a Chinese L-type Tourist Visa.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The application process is generally straightforward and requires:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <li>有效护照</li>
          <li>申请表格</li>
          <li>近照</li>
          <li>证明文件（按要求）</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/zh/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
          How to Apply for China Tourist Visa (L-Type) →
        </a>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="how-long" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">⏱️</span> How Long Does It Take?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Processing times vary by country and visa center. In most locations, standard processing takes 4–5 business days, though faster expedited services may be available for an additional fee.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="which-option" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🤔</span> Which Option Is Right for You?
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold"></th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-green-600">30天免签证</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-teal-600">共同协议</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-blue-600">240小时交通</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-purple-600">L旅游签证</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">谁有资格</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">50个国家</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">29个国家</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">55个国家</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">其他人</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">最大停留时间</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">我可以延期吗？</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">30-90天（有所不同）</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">10天（240小时）</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">📚 相关指南</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">提前文书工作</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">无（只显示）</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">无（只显示）</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">4-5个工作日</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">成本</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">自由</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">30美元-100美元</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">30美元-100美元</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">30美元-100美元</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">灵活性</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">随时随地旅行</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">区域受限</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">区域受限</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">区域限制</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">区域受限</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="faq" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❓</span> Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">号码</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>免签证入境意味着您根本不需要在护照上加盖签证章。你只需向移民局出示护照，他们就会让你入境。这与签证完全不同——这是没有签证。</strong> Visa-free entry means you don't need a visa stamp in your passport at all. You just show your passport to immigration and they let you in. It's completely different from having a visa — it's the absence of one.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">如果你住在酒店，他们会自动处理登记。如果你住在私人住宅，你的主人需要在24小时内在当地警察局为你登记。无论你是如何进入中国的，这都适用。</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">如果我有双重国籍怎么办？</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">中国不承认双重国籍。使用您打算进入中国的护照。如果你的护照来自免签证国家，那就用它——它简化了一切。</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">在申请签证之前，请检查您是否符合免签证入境或240小时过境政策的条件。如果没有，标准的L型旅游签证仍然是游客最常见的途径。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Before applying for a visa, check whether you qualify for visa-free entry or the 240-hour transit policy. If not, a standard L-type Tourist Visa remains the most common route for visitors.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">选择离您最近的中心——每个中心覆盖特定地区</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183390/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">国家移民局——单方面免签证国家名单</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183412/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国签证申请服务中心</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.visaforchina.cn/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">选择一个可用的日期和时间段</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国免签证国家名单（2026年）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">在预约当天前往签证中心。</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">240小时免签证过境说明</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">相互免签证协议（29个国家）</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/mutual-agreement/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">相互免签证协议（29个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">如何申请中国旅游签证（L型）</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何申请中国旅游签证（L型）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">如何在中国付款</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Alipay, WeChat Pay, and cash</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>